  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Crush the garlic. Thinly slice the capsicum. Coarsely grate half the cucumber, then thinly slice the remaining cucumber. Finely grate the parmesan. Drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373922/photos/large/prep_ingredients-e6099f25eb508d3f10478a90b159f0ca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast chickpeas: Put the chickpeas in a bowl, add the parmesan, 2 tsp harissa seasoning (see Make it milder) and 1 tbs olive oil. Season with salt and pepper, then toss to combine. Spread the chickpeas over the lined tray in a single layer and roast for 15 mins or until the parmesan is melted and the chickpeas are light golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373923/photos/large/roast_chickpeas-5c49b9675bec62a3b0859f9de64435e4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make yoghurt dressing: Meanwhile, combine the yoghurt, garlic and grated cucumber in a bowl. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373924/photos/large/make_yoghurt_dressing-632cbc3bd5d47b0e7b2e18b2483e981b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad: Put the salad leaves, sliced cucumber, capsicum and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373925/photos/large/make_salad-d559d9935dd5fc6c8661f16f4c89594b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the salad and chickpeas among bowls, drizzle with the yoghurt dressing and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373926/photos/large/serve_up-6e9e127b2d68fa0fa2470d3f1cd5115a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it milder: Harissa seasoning has a chilli kick. We've suggested this amount for flavour, but if you prefer less heat or have little ones, reduce the harissa to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2373927/photos/large/make_it_yours-63efcb126439142253495de2e611cf7f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
